always showing hex to people. I feel like, I don't actually, what you said about Context Studio

01:00:05.078 --> 01:00:10.438
really kind of blew my mind because I do like a lot of software engineering on data tools,

01:00:11.158 --> 01:00:18.117
but that strikes me as such a unique, maybe not totally unique problem across a lot of domains,

01:00:18.117 --> 01:00:21.638
but for data people that need to like curate and stamp and endorse.

01:00:22.358 --> 01:00:27.638
It's honestly like this moment in some ways is like a match made in heaven for data people for

01:00:27.638 --> 01:00:32.757
this workflow, because this is the workflow that data teams have been doing forever, but it's just

01:00:32.757 --> 01:00:40.757
been so painful and laborious for relatively little impact. Like if you think, or I mean,

01:00:40.757 --> 01:00:45.317
obviously there's impact, but like the amount of impact you get out of like all of this labor

